<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>灵动岛团块</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>所有改动约 0.5 秒自动生效，无需注销。建议顺序：先调「大小 / 长度 / 宽度」定形状，再调「上下 / 左右偏移」定位置。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用效果</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>长度（横杠横向拉伸）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>拉长 / 压短整团黑色部分的横向长度。1.0 为原始比例。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>lengthScale</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.5</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>2</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>1</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>宽度（纵向拉伸）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>拉高 / 压扁整团黑色部分。1.0 为原始比例。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>widthScale</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.5</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>2</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>1</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>大小（整体缩放）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>整团等比缩放，形状不变。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>sizeScale</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.5</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>2</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>1</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>上下偏移（默认 0 = 滑条正中）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>往左滑为负数 = 向上偏移；往右滑为正数 = 向下偏移。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>offsetY</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>-80</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>左右偏移（默认 0 = 滑条正中）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>往左滑为负数 = 向左偏移；往右滑为正数 = 向右偏移。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>offsetX</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>-150</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>150</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0</real>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
